	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Hongfa HFE80V-20C 800 V DC ceramic-sealed relay, HTPAJ (PCB pin) version. Load blades 2.5x0.8 mm on 12.7 mm pitch, 6.7 mm from body top edge: slot 3.1x1.4 mm, pad 4.5x2.8 mm. Coil pins 2.1x0.5 mm on 17 mm pitch, 19.75 mm below load row: slot 2.7x1.1 mm, pad 3.9x2.1 mm. Body 29.2x30 mm (origin = body center), height 30.1 mm. Pad numbers match the schematic K401 Relay:SANYOU_SRD_Form_A symbol: contacts = pads 3 and 1 (symbol pins 3/1), coil = pads 2 and 5 (symbol pins 2/5). Mapping: relay terminal 1(+) -> pad 3 (net DC_INPUT_P, supply side; load side is polarized, + marked on silk), relay terminal 2(-) -> pad 1 (precharge resistor side), coil terminal 5 -> pad 2, coil terminal 6 -> pad 5 (coil is non-polarized per datasheet). Hongfa datasheet HFE80V-20C, HTPAJ outline p.133.")
	(tags "Hongfa HFE80V HV DC relay precharge")
